  <data name="About.Body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This site lists my public GitHub repositories. The list comes straight from the GitHub API, refreshed every thirty minutes; a handful of descriptions, translations and screenshots are written by hand and merged on top. Nothing here is a mirror of the code: every repository links back to GitHub, which remains the source of truth.</value>
