  <data name="Prompt.Help" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Filter — these commands are real navigations
  ls                   list the repositories
  ls --topic=unity     filter by topic
  ls --lang=rust       filter by language
  ls --demo            those with a live demo
  ls --no-archived     hide archived repositories
  find &lt;term&gt;          search names and descriptions

Move around
  open &lt;repository&gt;    open a repository page
  cd about             go to the About page
  cd /                 back to the list

Find out
  whoami               who owns these repositories
  stats                repositories, languages, stars
  topics               topics and how often they appear
  langs                languages and how often they appear
  cache                where the data comes from

Comfort
  clear                clear the screen (Ctrl+L)
  history              commands typed so far
  ↑ ↓                  recall a command
  Tab                  complete a command, a topic, a repository

A few commands are of no use whatsoever: "eggs" lists them.</value>
